# A short stretch of the Netherby branch, dimensioned from the junction.

scheme netherby {
    area "Netherby branch"
    prefix N
}

node W boundary
node J plain
node E boundary

edge NE1 from W to J length 1610 speed 60 mileage "12m 0ch" direction down
edge NE2 from J to E length 1610 speed 60 direction down

section NA over NE1
section NB over NE2

signal N1 on NE1 at 1610 facing forward direction down aspects 3
